# Tutorial 11 - Subroutines and Flow Composition
@scenario {{SCENARIO_PREFIX}}_tutorial_11_subroutines
@include {{CHARACTERS_INCLUDE}}
{{BG_DECL}}@label start
{{BG_START}}[inc tutorial_count]
[textspeed 28]
[autodelay 1650]
[show lavender center talking]
Lavender: Welcome to Tutorial 11 - Subroutines and Flow Composition.
Lavender: This lesson is intentionally long-form, so your team can use it as a living reference.
Lavender: We'll cover guided sections, a dense reference sheet, and a mini practice scene.
Lavender: Focus area for this file: Reusable labels, calls, and structural composition.
Lavender: Primary command family: [call label].
narrator: Keep this file editable. Teams usually annotate these lines with project-specific conventions.

